{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sweetie Candy Maze: Red Cherry \u2014 is a colorful and fun maze game set in a world of juicy red cherry candies and sweet surprises. Collect all the sweets and find your way to the caramel portal to complete each level.<br><br>Each new maze brings more challenge and excitement as you explore deeper into the candy world!<br><br>In Sweetie Candy Maze: Red Cherry:<br><br>\u2022 50 levels of candy-filled fun<br>\u2022 Bright and tasty visuals<br>\u2022 Gradually increasing difficulty<br>\u2022 Addictive and cheerful gameplay<br>\u2022 Relaxing music<br>\u2022 Achievements<br>\u2022 Simple controls<br><br>Use Gamepads (Xbox One or Xbox 360), or keyboard (WASD or arrow keys) to navigate through the different mazes!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922210/extras/6470d2d132ecececbdfaaa17b9882a52.poster.avif?t=1760537251\" width=75 height=70 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922210/extras/6470d2d132ecececbdfaaa17b9882a52.webm?t=1760537251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922210/extras/c82a133162801c512349e8280e0add93.poster.avif?t=1760537251\" width=75 height=69 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922210/extras/c82a133162801c512349e8280e0add93.webm?t=1760537251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3922210/extras/0adcf5fdc21107bc31e82f42db6f2fc8.poster.avif?t=1760537251\" width=75 height